From: Ayoub Zaki <ayoub.zaki@embetrix.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Allow newer compatible termcolor releases

The client uses the colored() API supported by termcolor 2.2 and 3.x.
Remove the minor-version upper bound to allow the termcolor recipe in
wrynose without downgrading the shared dependency.

Upstream-Status: Pending

Signed-off-by: Ayoub Zaki <ayoub.zaki@embetrix.com>

--- a/pyproject.toml
+++ b/pyproject.toml
@@ -23,7 +23,7 @@
 dependencies = [
 	"websockets",
 	"requests",
-	"termcolor~=2.2.0"
+	"termcolor>=2.2.0"
 ]
 
 [build-system]
